    "title": "Miley Cyrus Brings Her Fiance & Family to ‘Hannah Montana 20′ Red Carpet Premiere! (Photos)",
    "text": "Miley Cyrus has the support of her loved ones at the Hannah Montana 20th Anniversary Special red carpet premiere! The 33-year-old actress and singer was joined by her fiance Maxx Morando while appearing on the carpet on Monday night (March 23) at the El Capitan Theatre in Hollywood. Miley was also joined by her mom Tish Cyrus with husband Dominic Purcell, sister Brandi Cyrus and her fiance Matt Southcombe, and other family members. Tish and her ex-husband Billy Ray Cyrus will both be making appearances in the special, which debuts on Disney+ and Hulu on March 24. You can start watching at 3am ET or midnight PT. While on the carpet, Miley also met up with many of the show’s original cast members and we have all those photos as well. Filmed in front of a live studio audience, the special promises to provide performances of classics of “Best of Both Worlds” and never-before-seen archival footage from the beloved TV show, as well as appearances from her parents, and an in-depth interview with Miley reflecting on the show and its legacy. Call Her Daddy podcast host Alex Cooper will host the special. Browse through the gallery for 40+ photos of Miley Cyrus and her family on the carpet…",
